        "id": "textbook-install-command",
        "moduleId": "install-path",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "教材：使用 Homebrew 安装 Python 3",
        "markdown": "教材给出的 macOS 安装入口是 Homebrew。打开终端后执行：\n\n```bash\nbrew install python3\n```\n\n由 Homebrew 负责下载并安装 Python 3，而不是手工下载安装包。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
